{"availability":"available","full":"manastokale/Lineage","name":"Lineage","description":"A screenplay intelligence app that lets users explore TV scripts, query characters from a precise moment, and retrieve continuity-aware arcs and interactions.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-20T01:28:58Z","updated":"2026-04-29T20:57:59Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://lineage-sooty.vercel.app","topics":["ai","chromadb","fastapi","llm","narrative-ai","rag","react","retrieval-augmented-generation","screenplay","vercel","vite"],"demo":"https://lineage-sooty.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:52.181Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:52.181Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:52.181Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:27:52.181Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Lineage is a moment-aware AI workspace for exploring Friends like a living script, not a flat transcript.","Pick a dialogue line, press Enter, and ask a character from that exact point in the episode. The answer is constrained by the script moment, prior character memory, shared interactions, and continuity guardrails, so characters do not casually know things that have not happened yet.","Most character chat demos collapse time. A character answers from the whole show, the internet, or vague recap memory."],"features":["Ask from a specific moment. Highlight a line, hit Enter, and the Ask cursor opens for that exact character/context.","Stay inside Friends canon. Ask is guarded to answer only from Friends context, resist prompt manipulation, and avoid future spoilers from a character POV.","Inspect continuity risks. The scanner flags possible contradictions by extracting semantic claims and validating them against prior memory.","Analyze edited dialogue. Change a line locally and run impact analysis only after the dialogue actually changes.","Explore relationship memory. The graph view shows prior character arcs and shared interactions before the active episode."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/manastokale/Lineage/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f9fb7d66fe99051497657c9186698388951bf47b4dcca22252e02a29481919a7","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:52.275Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:52.275Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Lineage is a moment-aware AI workspace for exploring Friends like a living script, not a flat transcript.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/manastokale/Lineage/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f9fb7d66fe99051497657c9186698388951bf47b4dcca22252e02a29481919a7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/manastokale/Lineage/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:52.275Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-04-29T20:57:59Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/manastokale/Lineage/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:52.276Z","hash":"f9fb7d66fe99051497657c9186698388951bf47b4dcca22252e02a29481919a7","originalBytes":4011,"storedBytes":4011,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["character","ask","memory","prior","continuity","line","local","arcs","exact","friends","lineage","memory.","vercel","answer","bash","context","dialogue","frontend","model","only","rerank","scene","scripts","shared","through","usage","what","actually","after","against","analysis","answers","characters","consumption","demos","deploy.md","dev","dialogue.","enter","episode.","episodes","export","fastapi","feature","friendsos.sh","graph","grounded","guardrails","health","impact","interaction","interactions","limits","live","locally","moment","moment.","narrative","possible","problem","prompt","provider","relationship","repo","retrieves","routing","rpd","run","scenes","script","selector","shows","stay","stop","system","traces.","active","analyze","anyone","api","app","avoid","backend","before"